{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05327","headline":"中宗降诞日长宁公主满月侍宴应制 · 郑愔","name":"中宗降诞日长宁公主满月侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春殿猗兰美，仙阶柏树荣。\n地逢芳节应，时覩圣人生。\n月满增祥荚，天长发瑞灵。\n南山遥可献，常愿奉皇明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05327.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05327","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}